</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bTfYFJ fFWOZc pf-126_ pf-heading-1-h3">1. Eligibility for Returns and Exchanges:
</h3><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-128_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1.&nbsp;Items must be in brand new, unused, and unworn condition, with all original tags and packaging intact.
