<br>3.&nbsp;Some items, such as personalized or customized products, perishable goods, and final sale items, are not eligible for return or exchange.
</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bTfYFJ fFWOZc pf-132_ pf-heading-1-h3">2. How to Initiate a Return or Exchange:
</h3><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-140_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1.&nbsp;To initiate a return or exchange, please log in to your RoverIsland account and follow the online instructions in the "Order History" section. You will need to provide your order number and a reason for the return or exchange.
<br>2.&nbsp;If you encounter any difficulties, you can contact our dedicated customer service team for assistance.
<br></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bTfYFJ fFWOZc pf-134_ pf-heading-1-h3">3. Shipping Costs:
</h3><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-142_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1.&nbsp;If the return or exchange is due to an error on our part (e.g., wrong item shipped, damaged item), RoverIsland will cover the return shipping costs.
<br>2.&nbsp;For returns or exchanges initiated for any other reason (e.g., change of mind, incorrect size ordered), the customer is responsible for the return shipping costs.
</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bTfYFJ fFWOZc pf-136_ pf-heading-1-h3">4. Refunds and Exchanges:
</h3><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-144_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1.&nbsp;Upon receiving your returned item(s) and verifying their condition, we will process your refund or exchange.
<br>2.&nbsp;Refunds will be issued to the original payment method within 7-10 business days of receiving the returned item(s).
<br>3.&nbsp;Exchanges will be processed promptly, and replacement items will be shipped as soon as possible.
</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bTfYFJ fFWOZc pf-138_ pf-heading-1-h3">5. Additional Information:
</h3><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-146_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">1.&nbsp;Refunds will only include the cost of the item(s) and applicable taxes. Shipping fees are non-refundable.
